// Title: Possible Impacket SecretDump Remote Activity
// ID: 252902e3-5830-4cf6-bf21-c22083dfd5cf
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Samir Bousseaden, wagga
// Date: 2019-04-03
// Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003.002, attack.t1003.004, attack.t1003.003
// Description: Detect AD credential dumping using impacket secretdump HKTL
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where (EventID = "5145" and ShareName = "\\\\\\\\\\*\\\\ADMIN$" and (RelativeTargetName matches "*SYSTEM32\\*" and RelativeTargetName matches "*.tmp*"))
